	(text "USB-C sink: 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2 (default USB power).\nBQ24074 power-path: OUT (VSYS) is fed from VBUS when present,\nbattery supplements via DPPM. EN2=1/EN1=0 -> ILIM resistor mode,\nR4 1.5k -> 1.03 A input limit. R5 2k -> 445 mA charge current.\nTMR open = default safety timers, ITERM open = 10% termination.\nTS: 10k fixed resistor (packs without NTC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110 222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "176e4521-86f8-59b5-ac1e-029c1c7400f4")
	)
	(text "VBAT sense: VBAT/3 on GPIO29 (ADC3), same scaling as Pico 2.\nDivider draws ~14 uA from the cell.\n3V3: TLV75733P 1 A LDO from VSYS; EN on header (pull low = off).\nBattery: JST-PH 2 pin, pin 1 = GND, pin 2 = +VBAT (Adafruit/SparkFun\npolarity). CHECK YOUR CELL'S POLARITY BEFORE CONNECTING."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 260 222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4e27d46-b1fe-5f64-b9ed-9e66ef825aef")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
